# Built-in DetectorFactory implementations.
#
# Deliberately NOT a META-INF/services file. ServiceLoader has to load a provider class before it
# can report that provider's type, so registering these for discovery cost every forked JVM about
# 340 ms loading 127 classes that buildExternal() then skipped by package name. They are
# addressability shims rather than a live detection path, so only DetectorRegistry.build() reads
# this list, and ServiceLoader at runtime sees only genuine third-party providers.
#
# One fully-qualified class name per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.

